.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-issue-board-view \- View project issue board.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab issue board view [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Opens an interactive view of the project's issue boards in your
terminal, where you can browse issues by list.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-a\fP, \fB--assignee\fP=""
	Filter board issues by assignee username.

.PP
\fB-l\fP, \fB--labels\fP=[]
	Filter board issues by labels. Multiple labels can be comma-separated or specified by repeating the flag.

.PP
\fB-m\fP, \fB--milestone\fP=""
	Filter board issues by milestone.

.PP
\fB--paginate\fP[=false]
	Make additional HTTP requests to retrieve all board issues.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository using the OWNER/REPO format or the project ID. Supports group namespaces.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
glab issue board view
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-issue-board(1)\fP
